event: thinking
data: {"id": "805c206f0c48497d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1463", "run_id": "805c206f0c48497d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "这个 Namespace 下只有这一个 Pod，且处于 Pending 状态。\n\n现在我已经有足够的证据来描述这个问题了：\n\n**根因结论**：\n\nPod `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 处于 **Pending** 状态，原因是 **FailedScheduling** - 节点选择器不匹配。\n\n**关键证据**：\n1. Pod 的 `nodeSelector` 为 `{\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`\n2. 集群中所有 3 个节点（master、node1、node2）都没有 `aiops.lab/unavailable` 这个标签\n3. Scheduler 事件显示：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`\n\n**影响**：Pod 持续 Pending，无法调度到任何节点运行。\n\n**注意**：这是一个由应用部署配置引起的调度失败（Node Selector 设置错误），不是集群资", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1788407388668, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "805c206f0c48497d-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "805c206f0c48497d", "seq": 1464, "ts_ms": 1788407398454, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 49.157, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-01", "name": "workload-68c557d875-llhkh"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/805c206f0c48497d-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "50ea09b994861ea0b9e24bd674317a953cdb4ac407d3733bf13bb0ad7d1a6728", "bytes": 2451}, "snapshot_sha256": "ebd4b063474cf0a2335f07010ff4e3f1a9d8af6f64c13af76adfc014421e1988"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

